window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>What's a girl to do when a vampire claims to be her mate? For Hollie, a human bystander drawn into a world of supernatural beings, not running was never an option. The problem is, he keeps finding her. With the help of her Fae friends and a witch with a clutter issue, Hollie has a plan to knock the vamp out of her life permanently. It's easier said than done when an imp in disguise starts to interfere. She's not sure what's worse: running away from the vamp or being caught by him.</p> <p><i>USA Today</i> best-selling author W.J. May creates a new paranormal series with a world of fae and magic. Escape into a realm of fantasy creatures, love and deception, betrayal and jealousy.</p>"; 
